  "placement": {
    "scatter": "Grass and weeds: one alpha-scissor surface each. Attach res://assets/props/warehouse_field/scatter.gd to shadowless MultiMeshInstance3D batches in roughly 8 m cells. Shuffle instance transforms per cell. Low draws 40% and fades at 24 m. Medium and High use full density and fade at 36 m. Shrubs and saplings also support shadowless batching.",
    "surfaces": "Set metadata/surface = \"grass\" on the StaticBody3D for the grassy floor (or call body.set_meta(\"surface\", \"grass\")). Separately apply the field_ground material to its visible mesh. This selects the grass footstep and impact banks.",
    "reuse": "The existing chain-link fence kit is res://assets/props/chainlink_fence/. Trailer dressing can use pallet_single and open_bulk_box from warehouse_photo with the 2.36 m clear centre lane preserved.",
